OL,3,GNEWSA'My wife would still be alive if  
OL,4,ANHS Grampian had followed medical      
OL,5,Aguidelines'                            
OL,7,FLaura Skaife-Knight, chief executive of
OL,8,FNHS Grampian, apologised to Helen's    
OL,9,Ffamily for "the failings in her care". 
